From 19cbe548a7c75c0e4081ebce0f9af37e4c135623 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:07:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Give each _run_agent invocation its own outcome
 receipt

A queued follow-up's recursive _run_agent now opens a fresh receipt and
makes it the handler's concluding one, so a predecessor worker writing
late (an abandoned worker's capture) can only write its own receipt.
Abandonment captures only a lease the worker holds now, not the cached
agent's previous holder. concluding_turn_identity drops its unused
runner/session_key params; prompt_turn uses turn_outcome._turn_sid.

Follow-up to PR #1753 reviews.
